        "TileImage": "$($repository a86b51f9-cce4-410e-b4f7-dff3b7e1b511).Image",
        "Description": "Some of the members of the Ark Society would like to remove the knight stand exhibition. Ark Council member, Bernadette Craig will be at the Isle of Sgail tonight to propose the idea (of selling off the knights to an unnamed buyer) to the rest of the council.  An extra two of her personal security are also in favor of this.\r\rPut a stop to anyone agreeing with the deal.\rWe NEED the nights to remain on the Isle.\r\rgood luck, 47.",
